WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.999
The hub sets a reporting point, shift times,
rider numbers and a preferred start date.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:15.999
Recruiters check documents and link each
rider to the right company and hub.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:23.999
For a rental EV, the field team records the
vehicle, rider and handover date.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000
The office checks earnings, rent and dues,
then checks the bank’s transfer results.
